  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "adult-census-income",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tAdult Census Income Dataset\n\t\n\nThe following was retrieved from UCI machine learning repository.\nThis data was extracted from the 1994 Census bureau database by Ronny Kohavi and Barry Becker (Data Mining and Visualization, Silicon Graphics). A set of reasonably clean records was extracted using the following conditions: ((AAGE>16) && (AGI>100) && (AFNLWGT>1) && (HRSWK>0)). The prediction task is to determine whether a person makes over $50K a year.\nDescription of fnlwgt (final weight)\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/scikit-learn/adult-census-income.",
  "alternateName": [
    "scikit-learn/adult-census-income"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "scikit-learn",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/scikit-learn"
